1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,940
If you get hot easily, this is one of the best inventions you'll see.

2
00:00:03,941 --> 00:00:04,941
It's a mini fan.

3
00:00:04,942 --> 00:00:08,301
It clips onto your shirt and blows air right to your face,

4
00:00:08,302 --> 00:00:11,361
and it feels amazing. It has three speeds,

5
00:00:11,380 --> 00:00:13,500
you can adjust the direction however you want,

6
00:00:13,501 --> 00:00:16,041
and the battery lasts a long time.

7
00:00:16,079 --> 00:00:17,140
If you're feeling hot,

8
00:00:17,141 --> 00:00:19,181
whether you're at a game or in the middle of summer,

9
00:00:19,182 --> 00:00:20,641
this thing is a lifesaver.

10
00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:22,660
It's super portable and really cool.

11
00:00:22,661 --> 00:00:25,081
I'm using it all summer. And you should get one too.
